  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/NPtX_yH46AgvuV5xb5VGN8Q32N73evhadAS1g8SDay8.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\nHint : In \\(\\triangle A B C \\frac{z_1-z_2}{z_3-z_2}=\\left|\\frac{z_1-z_2}{z_3-z_2}\\right|\\mathrm{i}^{\\pi / 2}=\\left|\\frac{z_1-z_2}{z_3-z_2}\\right| \\cdot i=\\frac{A B}{B C} \\cdot i=i\\)\n\\(\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{z}_1-\\mathrm{z}_2=\\mathrm{i}\\left(\\mathrm{z}_3-\\mathrm{z}_2\\right) \\Rightarrow-i \\mathrm{z}_1+\\mathrm{i} \\mathrm{z}_2=\\mathrm{z}_3-\\mathrm{z}_2 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{z}_3=-\\mathrm{i} \\mathrm{z}_1+(\\mathrm{i}+1) \\mathrm{z}_2=-\\mathrm{i} \\mathrm{z}_1+(1+\\mathrm{i}) \\mathrm{z}_2\\)",
